l4: $ G ⇒ apn g a ∈ (⟦ q / a ⟧ B) $ by imp_elim [l3, #2]

fpi_pts
-------
l1: $ G ⇒ ∀ x0 (x0 ∊ g → ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ Q ∧ x0 = nest q y)) ∧ ∀ q (q ∊ Q → apn g q ∈ B) $ by cab_elim [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ ∀ x0 (x0 ∊ g → ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ Q ∧ x0 = nest q y)) $ by and_elim_l [l1]
