fpi_mono
--------
l1: $ G , g ∊ fpi q Q B ⇒ g ∊ fpi q Q B $ by ax
l2: $ G , g ∊ fpi q Q B ⇒ ∀ z (z ∊ g → ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ Q ∧ z = nest q y)) ∧ ∀ q (q ∊ Q → apn g q ∈ B) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , g ∊ fpi q Q B ⇒ ∀ z (z ∊ g → ∃ q ∃ y (q ∊ Q ∧ z = nest q y)) $ by and_elim_l [l2]
