c10: $ G , b ∊ ivals j U N A2 ⇒ ∀ j (j ∊ N2 → vat b N2 j ∈ A2) ↔ ∀ a [j/a] (j ∊ N2 → vat b N2 j ∈ A2) $ by weaken [c9]
c11: $ G , b ∊ ivals j U N A2 ⇒ ∀ j (j ∊ N2 → vat b N2 j ∈ A2) $ by bi_elim_r [c10, c8]
c12: $ G , b ∊ ivals j U N A2 ⇒ b ∊ ivals j U N2 A2 $ by ivals_intro [b3, b5, c11]
