lemma d1_rf_det_ind {z x5 x6 x7 x8: set} (G: hyps) (b n e: set):
  $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ {z | ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield b n e x5 z x6 ∈ lrel → ra_recfield b n e x7 z x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x5 = fv nvf x7 → fv nvf x6 = fv nvf x8)} $
----
l1: $ G , k ∊ ω , o ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn o ⊆ {z | ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield b n e x5 z x6 ∈ lrel → ra_recfield b n e x7 z x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x5 = fv nvf x7 → fv nvf x6 = fv nvf x8)} , w = ⟨ k , o ⟩ , ra_recfield b n e x0 w x1 ∈ lrel , ra_recfield b n e x2 w x3 ∈ lrel , fv nvf x0 = fv nvf x2 ⇒ crn o ⊆ {z | ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield b n e x5 z x6 ∈ lrel → ra_recfield b n e x7 z x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x5 = fv nvf x7 → fv nvf x6 = fv nvf x8)} $ by ax
l2: $ G , k ∊ ω , o ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn o ⊆ {z | ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield b n e x5 z x6 ∈ lrel → ra_recfield b n e x7 z x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x5 = fv nvf x7 → fv nvf x6 = fv nvf x8)} , w = ⟨ k , o ⟩ , ra_recfield b n e x0 w x1 ∈ lrel , ra_recfield b n e x2 w x3 ∈ lrel , fv nvf x0 = fv nvf x2 ⇒ w = ⟨ k , o ⟩ $ by ax
