l6: $ G , k ∊ ω , o ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn o ⊆ {z | ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield b n e x5 z x6 ∈ lrel → ra_recfield b n e x7 z x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x5 = fv nvf x7 → fv nvf x6 = fv nvf x8)} , w = ⟨ k , o ⟩ , ra_recfield b n e x0 w x1 ∈ lrel , ra_recfield b n e x2 w x3 ∈ lrel , fv nvf x0 = fv nvf x2 ⇒ fv nvf x1 = fv nvf x3 $ by d1_rf_step [l1, l2, l3, l4, l5]
l7: $ G , k ∊ ω , o ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn o ⊆ {z | ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_recfield b n e x5 z x6 ∈ lrel → ra_recfield b n e x7 z x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x5 = fv nvf x7 → fv nvf x6 = fv nvf x8)} , w = ⟨ k , o ⟩ , ra_recfield b n e x0 w x1 ∈ lrel , ra_recfield b n e x2 w x3 ∈ lrel ⇒ fv nvf x0 = fv nvf x2 → fv nvf x1 = fv nvf x3 $ by imp_intro [l6]
