l18: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 (t = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x1 (scons x2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ h = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ a = x1) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 (t = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x1 (scons x2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ h = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ a = x1) $ by ax
l19: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 (t = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x1 (scons x2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ h = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ a = x1) ⇒ ∃ f ∃ g ∃ j (t = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons f (scons g ∅) ⟩ ∧ fv nvf j = y ∧ ra_nth_ctor g j a ∈ lrel) $ by ex_elim [l18, l17]
