l22: $ G , t = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x3 (scons x2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ h = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ a = x1 ∧ ra_nth_ctor x2 x4 x1 ∈ lrel ⇒ h = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ a = x1 ∧ ra_nth_ctor x2 x4 x1 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [l20]
