l24: $ G , t = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x3 (scons x2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ h = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ a = x1 ∧ ra_nth_ctor x2 x4 x1 ∈ lrel ⇒ a = x1 ∧ ra_nth_ctor x2 x4 x1 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [l22]
l25: $ G , t = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x3 (scons x2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ h = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ a = x1 ∧ ra_nth_ctor x2 x4 x1 ∈ lrel ⇒ a = x1 $ by and_elim_l [l24]
l26: $ G , t = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x3 (scons x2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ h = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ a = x1 ∧ ra_nth_ctor x2 x4 x1 ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_nth_ctor x2 x4 x1 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [l24]
l27: $ G , t = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x3 (scons x2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ h = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ a = x1 ∧ ra_nth_ctor x2 x4 x1 ∈ lrel ⇒ kr_nth_ctor ∈ ω $ by kr_nth_ctor_omega
