l9: $ G , z = ∅ ⇒ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_intro [l8]
l10: $ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_alpha
