l12: $ ∀ x0 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_congr [l11]
l13: $ ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_alpha
l14: $ ∀ x1 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_congr [l13]
l15: $ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_congr [l14]
l16: $ ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_alpha
l17: $ ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_congr [l16]
l18: $ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_congr [l17]
l19: $ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_congr [l18]
l20: $ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by iff_trans [l10, l12]
l21: $ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by iff_trans [l20, l15]
l22: $ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by iff_trans [l21, l19]
l23: $ G , z = ∅ ⇒ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ↔ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by weaken [l22]
l24: $ G , z = ∅ ⇒ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by bi_elim_r [l23, l9]
l25: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y ⇒ z = suc y $ by ax
l26: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y ⇒ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by ax
l27: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y , ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel $ by ax
l28: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y , ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel ⇒ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by weaken [l26]
l29: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y , ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel ⇒ z = suc y $ by weaken [l25]
l30: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y , ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3 $ by d1_ctl_step [l28, l29, l27]
l31: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y ⇒ ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3 $ by imp_intro [l30]
l32: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y ⇒ ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_intro [l31]
l33: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y ⇒ ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_intro [l32]
l34: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y ⇒ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_intro [l33]
l35: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y ⇒ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_intro [l34]
l36: $ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_alpha
l37: $ ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x1 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_alpha
l38: $ ∀ x0 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_congr [l37]
l39: $ ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_alpha
l40: $ ∀ x1 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_congr [l39]
l41: $ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_congr [l40]
l42: $ ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_alpha
l43: $ ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_congr [l42]
l44: $ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_congr [l43]
l45: $ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by all_congr [l44]
l46: $ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by iff_trans [l36, l38]
l47: $ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by iff_trans [l46, l41]
l48: $ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ⟺ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by iff_trans [l47, l45]
l49: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y ⇒ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) ↔ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 (ra_nth_ctor x0 x1 x2 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x0 x3 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x1 = z → fv nvf x1 ∈ fv nvf x3) $ by weaken [l48]
l50: $ G , y ∊ ω , ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = y → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) , z = suc y ⇒ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = z → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by bi_elim_r [l49, l35]
l51: $ G ⇒ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = n → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by omega_ind_named [l24, l50, #1]

lemma d1_ctor_lt (G: hyps) (c m k l: set):
  $ G ⇒ ra_nth_ctor c m k ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ ra_clen_c c l ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ fv nvf m ∈ fv nvf l $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ functional nvf $ by nvf_functional
l2: $ G ⇒ isset (fv nvf m) $ by fv_set [l1]
l3: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ r = fv nvf m $ by ax
l4: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ fv nvf m = r $ by eq_sym [l3]
l5: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ isset m $ by isset_var
l6: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ fv nvf m ∈ ω $ by nvf_omega [l5]
l7: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ r ∈ ω $ by wcel_eq_l [l4, l6]
l8: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ r ∊ ω $ by wcel_welc [l7]
l9: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ ∀ x5 ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c x5 x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = r → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by d1_ctor_lt_ind [l8]
l10: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor c x6 x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c c x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf x6 = r → fv nvf x6 ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_elim (t := $ c $) [l9]
l11: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor c m x7 ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c c x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf m = r → fv nvf m ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_elim (t := $ m $) [l10]
l12: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ ∀ x8 (ra_nth_ctor c m k ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c c x8 ∈ lrel → fv nvf m = r → fv nvf m ∈ fv nvf x8) $ by all_elim (t := $ k $) [l11]
l13: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ ra_nth_ctor c m k ∈ lrel → ra_clen_c c l ∈ lrel → fv nvf m = r → fv nvf m ∈ fv nvf l $ by all_elim (t := $ l $) [l12]
l14: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ ra_nth_ctor c m k ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#1]
l15: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ ra_clen_c c l ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#2]
l16: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ ra_clen_c c l ∈ lrel → fv nvf m = r → fv nvf m ∈ fv nvf l $ by imp_elim [l13, l14]
l17: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ fv nvf m = r → fv nvf m ∈ fv nvf l $ by imp_elim [l16, l15]
l18: $ G , r = fv nvf m ⇒ fv nvf m ∈ fv nvf l $ by imp_elim [l17, l4]
l19: $ G ⇒ fv nvf m ∈ fv nvf l $ by isset_elim [l2, l18]

lemma d1_bd_intro (G: hyps) (t a b n f e m k: set):
  $ G ⇒ fv nvf n = fv nvf a $ > $ G ⇒ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ fv nvf m = fv nvf b $ > $ G ⇒ ra_nth_ctor e m k ∈ lrel $ >
  $ G ⇒ d1_bd t a b $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m k ∈ lrel $ by and_intro [#3, #4]
l2: $ G ⇒ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m k ∈ lrel $ by and_intro [#2, l1]
l3: $ G ⇒ fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m k ∈ lrel $ by and_intro [#1, l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ ∃ z (fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m z ∈ lrel) $ by ex_intro [l3]
l5: $ G ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z (fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf y = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor e y z ∈ lrel) $ by ex_intro [l4]
l6: $ G ⇒ ∃ w ∃ y ∃ z (fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f w ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf y = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor w y z ∈ lrel) $ by ex_intro [l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ ∃ v ∃ w ∃ y ∃ z (fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n v w ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf y = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor w y z ∈ lrel) $ by ex_intro [l6]
l8: $ G ⇒ d1_bd t a b $ by ex_intro [l7]

lemma d1_bd_s (G: hyps) (t a b f g h i: set):
  $ G ⇒ d1_bd t a b $ > $ G ⇒ t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons f (scons g (scons h ∅)) ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ fv nvf a = suc (fv nvf i) $ > $ G ⇒ d1_bd h i b $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ ∃ n ∃ o ∃ q ∃ m ∃ k (fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel) $ by weaken [#1]
l2: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel ⇒ fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel $ by ax
l3: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel ⇒ fv nvf n = fv nvf a $ by and_elim_l [l2]
l4: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [l2]
l5: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_l [l4]
l6: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel ⇒ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [l4]
l7: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel ⇒ fv nvf m = fv nvf b $ by and_elim_l [l6]
l8: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [l6]
l9: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 (t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x4 ∃ x2 ∃ x5 ∃ x3 ∃ x6 (t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x4 (scons x5 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_s , scons x6 ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ∧ ra_nth_ty x3 x6 x1 x2 ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_nth_ty_cases [l5]
l10: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 $ by ax
l11: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [l10]
l12: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 $ by and_elim_r [l10]
l13: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [l12]
l14: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 $ by and_elim_r [l12]
l15: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ o = x1 $ by and_elim_l [l14]
l16: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ q = x2 $ by and_elim_r [l14]
l17: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ fv nvf n = fv nvf a $ by weaken [l3]
l18: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel $ by weaken [l5]
l19: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ fv nvf m = fv nvf b $ by weaken [l7]
l20: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel $ by weaken [l8]
l21: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ nvf = nvf $ by eq_refl
l22: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ fv nvf n = fv nvf ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ $ by fv_eq [l21, l13]
l23: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ fv nvf ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ = ∅ $ by nvf_nz
