l59: $ G , fv nvf n = fv nvf a ∧ ra_nth_ty t n o q ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = fv nvf b ∧ ra_nth_ctor q m k ∈ lrel , t = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ n = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ o = x1 ∧ q = x2 ⇒ kc_tcons ∈ ω $ by kc_tcons_omega
