l151: $ G , iprt D p t ∧ fv nvf n = i ∧ ra_nth_ty t n f e ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf m = c ∧ ra_nth_ctor e m K ∈ lrel , iprt D o q ∧ fv nvf r = i2 ∧ ra_nth_ty q r g h ∈ lrel ∧ fv nvf l = c2 ∧ ra_nth_ctor h l K2 ∈ lrel , iprt D a b ∧ fv nvf d = i ∧ fv nvf j = c ∧ fv nvf u = k ∧ ra_minor_idx b d j u ∈ lrel , ∃ w ∃ x ∃ y ∃ z (iprt D v w ∧ fv nvf x = i2 ∧ fv nvf y = c2 ∧ fv nvf z = k ∧ ra_minor_idx w x y z ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ w ∃ x ∃ y ∃ z (iprt D v w ∧ fv nvf x = i2 ∧ fv nvf y = c2 ∧ fv nvf z = k ∧ ra_minor_idx w x y z ∈ lrel) $ by ax
