i6: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset m $ by isset_var
i7: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset x4 $ by isset_var
i8: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset n $ by isset_var
i2: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
i4: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
i9: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset x2 $ by isset_var
i10: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset v $ by isset_var
i11: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ $ by opair_isset
i12: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset ⟨ m , n ⟩ $ by opair_isset
c7: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x1 = u ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_inj_c [c6, i1, i2, i3, i4]
c8: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x1 = u $ by and_elim_l [c7]
c9: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [c7]
c10: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x2 = v ∧ ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ = ⟨ m , n ⟩ $ by opair_inj_c [c9, i9, i11, i10, i12]
c11: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ = ⟨ m , n ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [c10]
c12: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x3 = m ∧ x4 = n $ by opair_inj_c [c11, i5, i7, i6, i8]
c13: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x4 = n $ by and_elim_r [c12]
c14: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ fv g d = fv g d $ by eq_refl
c15: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ apn (fv g d) x1 = apn (fv g d) u $ by apn_eq [c14, c8]
c16: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ = ⟨ n , apn (fv g d) u ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c13, c15]
c17: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j = j $ by eq_refl
c18: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ j , ⟨ n , apn (fv g d) u ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c17, c16]
c19: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ L = L $ by eq_refl
c20: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ n , apn (fv g d) u ⟩ ⟩ $ by welc_ap_eq [c19, c18, c3]
r3a: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
r3b: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ n , apn (fv g d) u ⟩ ⟩ $ by ex_elim [r3a, c20]
r2a: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
r2b: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ n , apn (fv g d) u ⟩ ⟩ $ by ex_elim [r2a, r3b]
r1a: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
r1b: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ n , apn (fv g d) u ⟩ ⟩ $ by ex_elim [r1a, r2b]
r0: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , o ∊ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ n , apn (fv g d) u ⟩ ⟩ $ by ex_elim [b2, r1b]
d1: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} ⊆ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ n , apn (fv g d) u ⟩ ⟩ $ by subset_intro [r0]
d2: $ G , k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ isset {x5 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (k = ⟨ x1 , ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , x4 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ x5 ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ x4 , apn (fv g d) x1 ⟩ ⟩)} $ by subset_isset [a3, d1]
d3: $ G , ∃ u ∃ v ∃ m ∃ n (k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ u ∃ v ∃ m ∃ n (k = ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ⟨ m , n ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
