t1b: $ G , ¬ ∃ j (irf D K v j) , o ∊ {y | (¬ ∃ i (irf D K v i) ∧ y ∊ n) ∨ ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K v i ∧ z ∊ n ∧ h ∊ ihsp L g t v i ∧ y = scons h z)} , ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K v i ∧ z ∊ n ∧ h ∊ ihsp L g t v i ∧ o = scons h z) , ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K v i ∧ z ∊ n ∧ h ∊ ihsp L g t v i ∧ o = scons h z) ⇒ ⊥ $ by ex_elim [t1a, t2b]
t0: $ G , ¬ ∃ j (irf D K v j) , o ∊ {y | (¬ ∃ i (irf D K v i) ∧ y ∊ n) ∨ ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K v i ∧ z ∊ n ∧ h ∊ ihsp L g t v i ∧ y = scons h z)} , ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K v i ∧ z ∊ n ∧ h ∊ ihsp L g t v i ∧ o = scons h z) ⇒ ⊥ $ by ex_elim [f6, t1b]
f7: $ G , ¬ ∃ j (irf D K v j) , o ∊ {y | (¬ ∃ i (irf D K v i) ∧ y ∊ n) ∨ ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K v i ∧ z ∊ n ∧ h ∊ ihsp L g t v i ∧ y = scons h z)} , ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K v i ∧ z ∊ n ∧ h ∊ ihsp L g t v i ∧ o = scons h z) ⇒ o ∊ n $ by bot_elim [t0]
f8: $ G , ¬ ∃ j (irf D K v j) , o ∊ {y | (¬ ∃ i (irf D K v i) ∧ y ∊ n) ∨ ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K v i ∧ z ∊ n ∧ h ∊ ihsp L g t v i ∧ y = scons h z)} ⇒ o ∊ n $ by or_elim [d2, d4, f7]
f9: $ G , ¬ ∃ j (irf D K v j) ⇒ {y | (¬ ∃ i (irf D K v i) ∧ y ∊ n) ∨ ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K v i ∧ z ∊ n ∧ h ∊ ihsp L g t v i ∧ y = scons h z)} ⊆ n $ by subset_intro [f8]
f10: $ G , ¬ ∃ j (irf D K v j) ⇒ isset n $ by isset_var
f11: $ G , ¬ ∃ j (irf D K v j) ⇒ isset {y | (¬ ∃ i (irf D K v i) ∧ y ∊ n) ∨ ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K v i ∧ z ∊ n ∧ h ∊ ihsp L g t v i ∧ y = scons h z)} $ by subset_isset [f10, f9]
g1: $ G ⇒ isset {y | (¬ ∃ i (irf D K v i) ∧ y ∊ n) ∨ ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K v i ∧ z ∊ n ∧ h ∊ ihsp L g t v i ∧ y = scons h z)} $ by or_elim [e0, c14, f11]

