s4: $ G , v ∊ ω , ihv D K L g t v ⊆ ihv D K L2 g t v , u = suc v , m = ihv D K L g t v , n = ihv D K L2 g t v ⇒ ihv D K L g t (suc v) = ⋃ (crn (csn ⟨ suc v , {y | (¬ ∃ i (irf D K v i) ∧ y ∊ m) ∨ ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K v i ∧ z ∊ m ∧ h ∊ ihsp L g t v i ∧ y = scons h z)} ⟩)) $ by d2_suc [s1, s2]
