n5: $ G , ⟨ q , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ fv t d ∧ o ∊ ap L ⟨ j , ⟨ e , apn (fv g d) q ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ j = j2 $ by weaken [#5]
