m0: $ G , w = ⟨ ⟨ d , o ⟩ , ⟨ suc d , {y | (¬ ∃ i (irf D K d i) ∧ y ∊ o) ∨ ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K d i ∧ z ∊ o ∧ h ∊ ihsp L P Q d i ∧ y = scons h z)} ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ ⟨ d , o ⟩ , ⟨ suc d , {y | (¬ ∃ i (irf D K d i) ∧ y ∊ o) ∨ ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K d i ∧ z ∊ o ∧ h ∊ ihsp L P Q d i ∧ y = scons h z)} ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
ns0: $ G ⇒ D2 = D $ by eq_sym [#1]
ns1: $ G ⇒ K2 = K $ by eq_sym [#2]
