n7: $ G , w = ⟨ ⟨ d , o ⟩ , ⟨ suc d , {y | (¬ ∃ i (irf D K d i) ∧ y ∊ o) ∨ ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K d i ∧ z ∊ o ∧ h ∊ ihsp L P Q d i ∧ y = scons h z)} ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ {y | (¬ ∃ i (irf D K d i) ∧ y ∊ o) ∨ ∃ i ∃ h ∃ z (irf D K d i ∧ z ∊ o ∧ h ∊ ihsp L P Q d i ∧ y = scons h z)} = {x7 | (¬ ∃ x1 (irf D2 K2 d x1) ∧ x7 ∊ o) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 (irf D2 K2 d x1 ∧ x3 ∊ o ∧ x2 ∊ ihsp L2 P2 Q2 d x1 ∧ x7 = scons x2 x3)} $ by weaken [n7a]
