r3: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ∈ fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u) $ by cxp_intro_c [k13, r2]
r4: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by cxp_intro_c [k10, r3]
r5: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u $ by ax
r6: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ∈ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) × u $ by cxp_intro_c [r4, r5]
r7: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ $ by ax
r8: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [r7]
r9: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ z ∈ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) × u $ by wcel_eq_l [r8, r6]
r10: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat p (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) × u $ by wcel_welc [r9]
s1: $ G , z ∊ ifold0 u E D W p mv R ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E D W p mv R $ by ax
s2: $ G , z ∊ ifold0 u E D W p mv R ⇒ z ∊ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) × u $ by ifold0_elim [s1, r10]
s3: $ G ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv R ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) × u $ by subset_intro [s2]

--| The inductive hypotheses' valuations off `ω`.
lemma d3_ihv_off (G: hyps) (D K L X Y N: class): $ G ⇒ isset N $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ N ∈ ω $ > $ G ⇒ ihv D K L X Y N = ⋃ (crn (csn ∅)) $
----
a1: $ G , n = N ⇒ n = N $ by ax
b1: $ G , n = N , n ∊ cdm (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) ⇒ n ∊ cdm (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) $ by ax
b2: $ G , n = N , n ∊ cdm (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) ⇒ n ∊ ω $ by omrec_cdm_elim [b1]
b3: $ G , n = N , n ∊ cdm (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) ⇒ n = N $ by ax
b4: $ G , n = N , n ∊ cdm (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) ⇒ N ∈ ω $ by wcel_intro [b3, b2]
b5: $ G , n = N , n ∊ cdm (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) ⇒ ¬ N ∈ ω $ by weaken [#2]
b6: $ G , n = N , n ∊ cdm (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) ⇒ ⊥ $ by not_elim [b5, b4]
a2: $ G , n = N ⇒ n ∊ cdm (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) → ⊥ $ by imp_intro [b6]
a3: $ G , n = N ⇒ fv (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) n = ∅ $ by fv_empty [a2]
a4: $ G , n = N ⇒ omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y) = omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y) $ by eq_refl
a5: $ G , n = N ⇒ N = n $ by eq_sym [a1]
a6: $ G , n = N ⇒ fv (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) N = fv (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) n $ by fv_eq [a4, a5]
a7: $ G , n = N ⇒ fv (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) N = ∅ $ by eq_trans [a6, a3]
a8: $ G , n = N ⇒ csn (fv (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) N) = csn ∅ $ by csn_eq [a7]
a9: $ G , n = N ⇒ crn (csn (fv (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) N)) = crn (csn ∅) $ by crn_eq [a8]
a10: $ G , n = N ⇒ ⋃ (crn (csn (fv (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) N))) = ⋃ (crn (csn ∅)) $ by cuni_eq [a9]
a11: $ G ⇒ ⋃ (crn (csn (fv (omrec ⟨ ∅ , csn ∅ ⟩ (ihst D K L X Y)) N))) = ⋃ (crn (csn ∅)) $ by isset_elim [#1, a10]

--| `ihv_mono` at any set.
ihv_mono_c
----------
c1: $ G , N ∈ ω ⇒ N ∈ ω $ by ax
c2: $ G , N ∈ ω ⇒ L ⊆ L2 $ by weaken [#3]
c4: $ G , N ∈ ω ⇒ isset Y $ by weaken [#1]
c5: $ G , N ∈ ω ⇒ ap L2 a ⊆ crn L2 $ by ap_subset_crn
c6: $ G , N ∈ ω ⇒ isset L2 $ by weaken [#2]
c7: $ G , N ∈ ω ⇒ isset (crn L2) $ by crn_set [c6]
c8: $ G , N ∈ ω ⇒ isset (ap L2 a) $ by subset_isset [c7, c5]
c9: $ G , N ∈ ω ⇒ ∀ a (isset (ap L2 a)) $ by all_intro [c8]
c3: $ G , N ∈ ω ⇒ ihv D K L X Y N ⊆ ihv D K L2 X Y N $ by ihv_mono [c4, c9, c2, c1]
d1: $ G , ¬ N ∈ ω ⇒ ¬ N ∈ ω $ by ax
d2: $ G , ¬ N ∈ ω ⇒ isset N $ by weaken [#4]
d3: $ G , ¬ N ∈ ω ⇒ ihv D K L X Y N = ⋃ (crn (csn ∅)) $ by d3_ihv_off [d2, d1]
d4: $ G , ¬ N ∈ ω ⇒ ihv D K L2 X Y N = ⋃ (crn (csn ∅)) $ by d3_ihv_off [d2, d1]
d5: $ G , ¬ N ∈ ω ⇒ ⋃ (crn (csn ∅)) = ihv D K L2 X Y N $ by eq_sym [d4]
d6: $ G , ¬ N ∈ ω ⇒ ihv D K L X Y N = ihv D K L2 X Y N $ by eq_trans [d3, d5]
d7: $ G , ¬ N ∈ ω ⇒ ihv D K L X Y N ⊆ ihv D K L2 X Y N $ by eq_subset [d6]
e1: $ G ⇒ N ∈ ω ∨ ¬ N ∈ ω $ by excluded_middle
e2: $ G ⇒ ihv D K L X Y N ⊆ ihv D K L2 X Y N $ by or_elim [e1, c3, d7]

--| One step of the fold is monotone in the relation.
lemma d3_f0_mono_c (G: hyps) (E D W S M R R2: class) (u: set):
  $ G ⇒ isset R2 $ > $ G ⇒ R ⊆ R2 $ > $ G ⇒ ifold0 u E D W S M R ⊆ ifold0 u E D W S M R2 $
----
k1: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ictk D j c o $ by ax
k2: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by ax
k3: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W $ by ax
k4: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) $ by ax
k5: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ iminx D j c k $ by ax
k6: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u $ by ax
k7: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ $ by ax
m1: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ R ⊆ R2 $ by weaken [#2]
m0: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ isset R2 $ by weaken [#1]
mt: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ isset t $ by isset_var
m2: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ isset f $ by isset_var
m3: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ isset (cdm f) $ by cdm_set [m2]
m4: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) ⊆ ihv D o R2 g t (cdm f) $ by ihv_mono_c [mt, m0, m1, m3]
m5: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ h ∊ ihv D o R2 g t (cdm f) $ by subset_elim [m4, k4]
m6: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E D W S M R2 $ by ifold0_intro [k1, k2, k3, m5, k5, k6, k7]
n1: $ G , z ∊ ifold0 u E D W S M R ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E D W S M R $ by ax
n2: $ G , z ∊ ifold0 u E D W S M R ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E D W S M R2 $ by ifold0_elim [n1, m6]
n3: $ G ⇒ ifold0 u E D W S M R ⊆ ifold0 u E D W S M R2 $ by subset_intro [n2]

lemma d3_f0_eq (G: hyps) (E D W S M R R2: class) (u: set):
  $ G ⇒ isset R $ > $ G ⇒ R = R2 $ > $ G ⇒ ifold0 u E D W S M R = ifold0 u E D W S M R2 $
----
e0: $ G ⇒ isset R2 $ by isset_eq [#2, #1]
e1: $ G ⇒ R ⊆ R2 $ by eq_subset [#2]
e2: $ G ⇒ R2 = R $ by eq_sym [#2]
e3: $ G ⇒ R2 ⊆ R $ by eq_subset [e2]
e4: $ G ⇒ ifold0 u E D W S M R ⊆ ifold0 u E D W S M R2 $ by d3_f0_mono_c [e0, e1]
e5: $ G ⇒ ifold0 u E D W S M R2 ⊆ ifold0 u E D W S M R $ by d3_f0_mono_c [#1, e3]
e6: $ G ⇒ ifold0 u E D W S M R = ifold0 u E D W S M R2 $ by subset_antisym [e4, e5]

--| The fold's carrier is a set.
ifold_car_set
-------------
c1: $ G ⇒ isset u $ by isset_var
c2: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
c3: $ G ⇒ isset (fseq u) $ by fseq_set [c1]
c4: $ G ⇒ isset (ω ∪ u) $ by cun_set [c2, c1]
c5: $ G ⇒ isset (fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by fseq_set [c4]
c6: $ G ⇒ isset (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by cxp_set [c3, c5]
c7: $ G ⇒ isset (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) $ by cxp_set [c2, c6]
c8: $ G ⇒ isset ((ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u) $ by cxp_set [c7, c1]

ifold0_mono
-----------
l1: $ G , a ⊆ b ⇒ a ⊆ b $ by ax
l0: $ G , a ⊆ b ⇒ isset b $ by isset_var
l2: $ G , a ⊆ b ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv a ⊆ ifold0 u E D W p mv b $ by d3_f0_mono_c [l0, l1]
l3: $ G ⇒ mono r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) $ by mono_intro (B := $ ifold0 u E D W p mv r $) [l2]

ifold0_setop
------------
s1: $ _ ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv r ⊆ (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u $ by ifold0_sub
s2: $ _ ⇒ isset ((ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u) $ by ifold_car_set
s3: $ _ ⇒ isset (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) $ by subset_isset [s2, s1]
s4: $ _ ⇒ setop r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) $ by setop_intro [s3]
s5: $ G ⇒ setop r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) $ by weaken [s4]

ifold_fix
---------
b1: $ G , a ⊆ (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv a ⊆ (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u $ by ifold0_sub
b2: $ G ⇒ bounded r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) ((ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u) $ by bounded_intro (B := $ ifold0 u E D W p mv r $) [b1]
b3: $ G ⇒ mono r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) $ by ifold0_mono
b4: $ G ⇒ setop r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) $ by ifold0_setop
b5: $ G ⇒ isset ((ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u) $ by ifold_car_set
b6: $ G ⇒ cap r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) (ifold u E D W p mv) = ifold u E D W p mv $ by lfp_fix [b3, b4, b2, b5]

ifold_sub
---------
b1: $ G , a ⊆ (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv a ⊆ (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u $ by ifold0_sub
b2: $ G ⇒ bounded r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) ((ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u) $ by bounded_intro (B := $ ifold0 u E D W p mv r $) [b1]
b4: $ G ⇒ setop r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) $ by ifold0_setop
b6: $ G ⇒ ifold u E D W p mv ⊆ (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u $ by lfp_bounded [b2, b4]

ifold_set
---------
i1: $ G ⇒ ifold u E D W p mv ⊆ (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u $ by ifold_sub
i2: $ G ⇒ isset ((ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u) $ by ifold_car_set
i3: $ G ⇒ isset (ifold u E D W p mv) $ by subset_isset [i2, i1]

ifold_intro
-----------
i1: $ G ⇒ ifold u E D W p mv ⊆ (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u $ by ifold_sub
i2: $ G ⇒ isset ((ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u) $ by ifold_car_set
i3: $ G ⇒ isset (ifold u E D W p mv) $ by subset_isset [i2, i1]
a1: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ a = ifold u E D W p mv $ by ax
a2: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ cap r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) (ifold u E D W p mv) = ifold0 u E D W p mv a $ by cap_eq [a1]
a3: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ cap r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) (ifold u E D W p mv) = ifold u E D W p mv $ by ifold_fix
a2b: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv a = cap r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) (ifold u E D W p mv) $ by eq_sym [a2]
a4: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv a = ifold u E D W p mv $ by eq_trans [a2b, a3]
a5: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ ifold u E D W p mv = a $ by eq_sym [a1]
a5i: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ isset (ifold u E D W p mv) $ by weaken [i3]
a6: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv (ifold u E D W p mv) = ifold0 u E D W p mv a $ by d3_f0_eq [a5i, a5]
a7: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv (ifold u E D W p mv) = ifold u E D W p mv $ by eq_trans [a6, a4]
a8: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E D W p mv (ifold u E D W p mv) $ by weaken [#1]
a9: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ z ∊ ifold u E D W p mv $ by welc_eq [a7, a8]
a10: $ G ⇒ z ∊ ifold u E D W p mv $ by isset_elim [i3, a9]

ifold_elim
----------
i1: $ G ⇒ ifold u E D W p mv ⊆ (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u $ by ifold_sub
i2: $ G ⇒ isset ((ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u) $ by ifold_car_set
i3: $ G ⇒ isset (ifold u E D W p mv) $ by subset_isset [i2, i1]
a1: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ a = ifold u E D W p mv $ by ax
a2: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ cap r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) (ifold u E D W p mv) = ifold0 u E D W p mv a $ by cap_eq [a1]
a3: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ cap r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) (ifold u E D W p mv) = ifold u E D W p mv $ by ifold_fix
a2b: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv a = cap r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) (ifold u E D W p mv) $ by eq_sym [a2]
a4: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv a = ifold u E D W p mv $ by eq_trans [a2b, a3]
a5: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ ifold u E D W p mv = a $ by eq_sym [a1]
a5i: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ isset (ifold u E D W p mv) $ by weaken [i3]
a6: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv (ifold u E D W p mv) = ifold0 u E D W p mv a $ by d3_f0_eq [a5i, a5]
a7: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv (ifold u E D W p mv) = ifold u E D W p mv $ by eq_trans [a6, a4]
a8: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ ifold u E D W p mv = ifold0 u E D W p mv (ifold u E D W p mv) $ by eq_sym [a7]
a9: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ z ∊ ifold u E D W p mv $ by weaken [#1]
a10: $ G , a = ifold u E D W p mv ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E D W p mv (ifold u E D W p mv) $ by welc_eq [a8, a9]
a11: $ G ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E D W p mv (ifold u E D W p mv) $ by isset_elim [i3, a10]

ifold_ind
---------
b1: $ G , a ⊆ (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u ⇒ ifold0 u E D W p mv a ⊆ (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u $ by ifold0_sub
b2: $ G ⇒ bounded r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) ((ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u) $ by bounded_intro (B := $ ifold0 u E D W p mv r $) [b1]
b3: $ G ⇒ mono r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) $ by ifold0_mono
b4: $ G ⇒ setop r (ifold0 u E D W p mv r) $ by ifold0_setop
b5: $ G ⇒ isset ((ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u) $ by ifold_car_set
h1: $ G ⇒ v ⊆ ifold u E D W p mv → v ⊆ {y | P} → ifold0 u E D W p mv v ⊆ {y | P} $ by all_elim [#1]
h2: $ G ⇒ ∀ v (v ⊆ ifold u E D W p mv → v ⊆ {y | P} → ifold0 u E D W p mv v ⊆ {y | P}) $ by all_intro [h1]
h3: $ G ⇒ ifold u E D W p mv ⊆ {y | P} $ by lfp_ind [b3, b4, b2, b5, h2]

--| One step of the fold reads `E` at subtrees of `D` only.
lemma d3_f0_local (G: hyps) (E E2 D W S M R: class) (u: set):
  $ G ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ > $ G ⇒ ifold0 u E D W S M R ⊆ ifold0 u E2 D W S M R $
----
k1: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ictk D j c o $ by ax
k2: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by ax
k3: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W $ by ax
k4: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) $ by ax
k5: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ iminx D j c k $ by ax
k6: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u $ by ax
k7: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ $ by ax
m1: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
m2: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ by weaken [#2]
m3: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ o ∈ fv tsub D $ by ictk_tsub [m1, k1]
m4: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ fv tsub D ⊆ trees ω $ by tsub_trees
m5: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ o ∈ trees ω $ by wcel_subset [m4, m3]
m6: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ eagr E E2 o $ by eagr_sub [m2, m3]
m7: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) = etel u E2 o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by etel_local [m5, m6]
m8: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ifam u E D W = ifam u E2 D W $ by ifam_local [m1, m2]
m9d: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ D = D $ by eq_refl
m9w: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ W = W $ by eq_refl
m9: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ixs D W (ifam u E D W) = ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W) $ by ixs_eq [m9d, m9w, m8]
m10: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ S = S $ by eq_refl
m11: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) = scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W)) $ by scat_eq [m10, m9]
m12: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ fv (etf u E2) o = fv (etf u E2) o $ by eq_refl
m13: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ W = W $ by eq_refl
m14: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ da (fv (etf u E2) o) W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) = da (fv (etf u E2) o) W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) $ by da_eq [m12, m13, m11]
m15: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) = etel u E2 o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) $ by eq_trans [m7, m14]
m16: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) $ by wcel_eq_r [m15, k2]
m17: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E2 D W $ by wcel_eq_r [m8, k3]
m18: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E2 D W S M R $ by ifold0_intro [k1, m16, m17, k4, k5, k6, k7]
n1: $ G , z ∊ ifold0 u E D W S M R ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E D W S M R $ by ax
n2: $ G , z ∊ ifold0 u E D W S M R ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E2 D W S M R $ by ifold0_elim [n1, m18]
n3: $ G ⇒ ifold0 u E D W S M R ⊆ ifold0 u E2 D W S M R $ by subset_intro [n2]

--| One inclusion of `ifold_local`.
lemma d3_fold_local (G: hyps) (E E2 D W S M: class) (u: set):
  $ G ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ > $ G ⇒ ifold u E D W S M ⊆ ifold u E2 D W S M $
----
i1: $ G ⇒ ifold u E2 D W S M ⊆ (ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u $ by ifold_sub
i2: $ G ⇒ isset ((ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u))) × u) $ by ifold_car_set
i3: $ G ⇒ isset (ifold u E2 D W S M) $ by subset_isset [i2, i1]
a1: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ b = ifold u E2 D W S M $ by ax
a2: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
a3: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ by weaken [#2]
a4: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ ifold0 u E D W S M b ⊆ ifold0 u E2 D W S M b $ by d3_f0_local [a2, a3]
a0: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ isset b $ by isset_var
a5: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ ifold0 u E2 D W S M b = ifold0 u E2 D W S M (ifold u E2 D W S M) $ by d3_f0_eq [a0, a1]
a6: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M , z ∊ ifold0 u E2 D W S M (ifold u E2 D W S M) ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E2 D W S M (ifold u E2 D W S M) $ by ax
a7: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M , z ∊ ifold0 u E2 D W S M (ifold u E2 D W S M) ⇒ z ∊ ifold u E2 D W S M $ by ifold_intro [a6]
a8: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ ifold0 u E2 D W S M (ifold u E2 D W S M) ⊆ ifold u E2 D W S M $ by subset_intro [a7]
a5b: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ ifold0 u E2 D W S M (ifold u E2 D W S M) = ifold0 u E2 D W S M b $ by eq_sym [a5]
a9: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ ifold0 u E2 D W S M b ⊆ ifold u E2 D W S M $ by subset_eq_l [a5b, a8]
a10: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ ifold u E2 D W S M = b $ by eq_sym [a1]
a11: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ ifold0 u E2 D W S M b ⊆ b $ by subset_eq_r [a10, a9]
a12: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ ifold0 u E D W S M b ⊆ b $ by subset_trans [a4, a11]
a13: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ mono r (ifold0 u E D W S M r) $ by ifold0_mono
a14: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ setop r (ifold0 u E D W S M r) $ by ifold0_setop
a15: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ ifold u E D W S M ⊆ b $ by lfp_least [a13, a14, a12]
a16: $ G , b = ifold u E2 D W S M ⇒ ifold u E D W S M ⊆ ifold u E2 D W S M $ by subset_eq_r [a1, a15]
a17: $ G ⇒ ifold u E D W S M ⊆ ifold u E2 D W S M $ by isset_elim [i3, a16]

ifold_local
-----------
l1: $ G ⇒ ifold u E D W p mv ⊆ ifold u E2 D W p mv $ by d3_fold_local [#1, #2]
l2: $ G ⇒ eagr E2 E D $ by eagr_sym [#2]
l3: $ G ⇒ ifold u E2 D W p mv ⊆ ifold u E D W p mv $ by d3_fold_local [#1, l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ ifold u E D W p mv = ifold u E2 D W p mv $ by subset_antisym [l1, l3]

--| Cases of a point of the recursor.
irc_elim
--------
l1: $ G ⇒ ∃ p ∃ q ∃ e ∃ m ∃ n ∃ o ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ x ∃ y (iprt D q e ∧ p ∊ esat u E q W ∧ m ∊ imots u E D W p v ∧ n ∊ imins u E D W p m ∧ ityf D i o ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p ∧ x ∊ apn (ity u E D i W) (scat f p) ∧ y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ i , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ ∧ z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y) $ by cab_elim [#1]
i9: $ H , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p v , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D i o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D i W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ i , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y → c0 $ by imp_intro [#2]
i8: $ H , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p v , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D i o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D i W) (scat f p) ⇒ y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ i , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ → z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y → c0 $ by imp_intro [i9]
i7: $ H , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p v , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D i o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p ⇒ x ∊ apn (ity u E D i W) (scat f p) → y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ i , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ → z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y → c0 $ by imp_intro [i8]
