i5: $ H , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p v , n ∊ imins u E D W p m ⇒ ityf D i o → ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p → x ∊ apn (ity u E D i W) (scat f p) → y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ i , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ → z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y → c0 $ by imp_intro [i6]
i4: $ H , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p v ⇒ n ∊ imins u E D W p m → ityf D i o → ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p → x ∊ apn (ity u E D i W) (scat f p) → y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ i , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ → z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y → c0 $ by imp_intro [i5]
i3: $ H , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W ⇒ m ∊ imots u E D W p v → n ∊ imins u E D W p m → ityf D i o → ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p → x ∊ apn (ity u E D i W) (scat f p) → y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ i , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ → z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y → c0 $ by imp_intro [i4]
