lemma d3_imq_sub (G: hyps) (E E2 D J W S: class) (u: set):
  $ G ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ > $ G ⇒ imq u E D J W S ⊆ imq u E2 D J W S $
----
k1: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ ityf D J o $ by ax
k2: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S $ by ax
k3: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) $ by ax
k4: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ z = scons x f $ by ax
m1: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
m2: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ by weaken [#2]
m3: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ o ∈ fv tsub D $ by ityf_tsub [m1, k1]
m4: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ fv tsub D ⊆ trees ω $ by tsub_trees
m5: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ o ∈ trees ω $ by wcel_subset [m4, m3]
m6: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ eagr E E2 o $ by eagr_sub [m2, m3]
m7: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ etel u E o W S = etel u E2 o W S $ by etel_local [m5, m6]
m8: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 o W S $ by wcel_eq_r [m7, k2]
m9: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ ity u E D J W = ity u E2 D J W $ by ity_local [m1, m2]
m10: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ scat f S = scat f S $ by eq_refl
m11: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) = apn (ity u E2 D J W) (scat f S) $ by apn_eq [m9, m10]
m12: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ x ∊ apn (ity u E2 D J W) (scat f S) $ by welc_eq [m11, k3]
m13: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ z ∊ imq u E2 D J W S $ by imq_intro [k1, m8, m12, k4]
n1: $ G , z ∊ imq u E D J W S ⇒ z ∊ imq u E D J W S $ by ax
n2: $ G , z ∊ imq u E D J W S ⇒ z ∊ imq u E2 D J W S $ by imq_elim [n1, m13]
n3: $ G ⇒ imq u E D J W S ⊆ imq u E2 D J W S $ by subset_intro [n2]

lemma d3_imot_sub (G: hyps) (E E2 D J W S V: class) (u: set):
  $ G ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ > $ G ⇒ imot u E D J W S V ⊆ imot u E2 D J W S V $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ imq u E D J W S ⊆ imq u E2 D J W S $ by d3_imq_sub [#1, #2]
l2: $ G ⇒ eagr E2 E D $ by eagr_sym [#2]
l3: $ G ⇒ imq u E2 D J W S ⊆ imq u E D J W S $ by d3_imq_sub [#1, l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ imq u E D J W S = imq u E2 D J W S $ by subset_antisym [l1, l3]
l5: $ G , q ∊ imq u E D J W S ⇒ fv uni V ⊆ fv uni V $ by subset_refl
l6: $ G ⇒ q ∊ imq u E D J W S → fv uni V ⊆ fv uni V $ by imp_intro [l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ ∀ q (q ∊ imq u E D J W S → fv uni V ⊆ fv uni V) $ by all_intro [l6]
l8: $ G ⇒ fpi q (imq u E D J W S) (fv uni V) ⊆ fpi q (imq u E2 D J W S) (fv uni V) $ by fpi_sub [l4, l7]

lemma d3_imots_sub (G: hyps) (E E2 D W S V: class) (u: set):
  $ G ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ > $ G ⇒ imots u E D W S V ⊆ imots u E2 D W S V $
----
l1: $ G , j ∊ intys D ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
l2: $ G , j ∊ intys D ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ by weaken [#2]
l3: $ G , j ∊ intys D ⇒ imot u E D j W S V ⊆ imot u E2 D j W S V $ by d3_imot_sub [l1, l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ j ∊ intys D → imot u E D j W S V ⊆ imot u E2 D j W S V $ by imp_intro [l3]
l5: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (j ∊ intys D → imot u E D j W S V ⊆ imot u E2 D j W S V) $ by all_intro [l4]
l6: $ G ⇒ ivals j u (intys D) (imot u E D j W S V) ⊆ ivals j u (intys D) (imot u E2 D j W S V) $ by ivals_mono [l5]

--| The etel conversion of the minors' parts.
lemma d3_mpart (G: hyps) (E E2 D I C W S: class) (u o f g t a: set):
  $ G ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ > $ G ⇒ ictk D I C o $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ >
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) $
----
m3: $ G ⇒ o ∈ fv tsub D $ by ictk_tsub [#1, #3]
m4: $ G ⇒ fv tsub D ⊆ trees ω $ by tsub_trees
m5: $ G ⇒ o ∈ trees ω $ by wcel_subset [m4, m3]
m6: $ G ⇒ eagr E E2 o $ by eagr_sub [#2, m3]
m7: $ G ⇒ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) = etel u E2 o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by etel_local [m5, m6]
m8: $ G ⇒ ifam u E D W = ifam u E2 D W $ by ifam_local [#1, #2]
m9d: $ G ⇒ D = D $ by eq_refl
m9w: $ G ⇒ W = W $ by eq_refl
m9: $ G ⇒ ixs D W (ifam u E D W) = ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W) $ by ixs_eq [m9d, m9w, m8]
m10: $ G ⇒ S = S $ by eq_refl
m11: $ G ⇒ scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) = scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W)) $ by scat_eq [m10, m9]
m12: $ G ⇒ fv (etf u E2) o = fv (etf u E2) o $ by eq_refl
m13: $ G ⇒ W = W $ by eq_refl
m14: $ G ⇒ da (fv (etf u E2) o) W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) = da (fv (etf u E2) o) W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) $ by da_eq [m12, m13, m11]
m15: $ G ⇒ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) = etel u E2 o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) $ by eq_trans [m7, m14]
m16: $ G ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) $ by wcel_eq_r [m15, #4]

lemma d3_iminq_sub (G: hyps) (E E2 D I C W S M: class) (u: set):
  $ G ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ > $ G ⇒ iminq u E D I C W S M ⊆ iminq u E2 D I C W S M $
----
k1: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ ictk D I C o $ by ax
k2: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by ax
k3: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) $ by ax
k4: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ z = scat h f $ by ax
m1: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
m2: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ by weaken [#2]
m3: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) $ by d3_mpart [m1, m2, k1, k2]
m4: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ z ∊ iminq u E2 D I C W S M $ by iminq_intro [k1, m3, k3, k4]
n1: $ G , z ∊ iminq u E D I C W S M ⇒ z ∊ iminq u E D I C W S M $ by ax
n2: $ G , z ∊ iminq u E D I C W S M ⇒ z ∊ iminq u E2 D I C W S M $ by iminq_elim [n1, m4]
n3: $ G ⇒ iminq u E D I C W S M ⊆ iminq u E2 D I C W S M $ by subset_intro [n2]

lemma d3_iminv_sub {o f g t a h y x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 x7: set} (G: hyps) (E E2 D I C W S M: class) (u q: set):
  $ G ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ > $ G ⇒ {y | ∃ o ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ h (ictk D I C o ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) ∧ q = scat h f ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))))} ⊆ {x7 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (ictk D I C x1 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 x1 W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) ∧ x6 ∊ ihv D x1 (imrel D M) x3 x4 (cdm x2) ∧ q = scat x6 x2 ∧ x7 ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C x3 W) (cres x5 (inidx D I))))} $
----
k1: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , q = scat h f , z ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))) ⇒ ictk D I C o $ by ax
k2: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , q = scat h f , z ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))) ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by ax
k3: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , q = scat h f , z ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))) ⇒ h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) $ by ax
k4: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , q = scat h f , z ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))) ⇒ q = scat h f $ by ax
k5: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , q = scat h f , z ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))) ⇒ z ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))) $ by ax
m1: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , q = scat h f , z ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))) ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
m2: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , q = scat h f , z ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))) ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ by weaken [#2]
m3: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , q = scat h f , z ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))) ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) $ by d3_mpart [m1, m2, k1, k2]
m4: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , q = scat h f , z ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))) ⇒ z ∊ {x7 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (ictk D I C x1 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 x1 W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) ∧ x6 ∊ ihv D x1 (imrel D M) x3 x4 (cdm x2) ∧ q = scat x6 x2 ∧ x7 ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C x3 W) (cres x5 (inidx D I))))} $ by iminv_intro [k1, m3, k3, k4, k5]
n1: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ o ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ h (ictk D I C o ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) ∧ q = scat h f ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))))} ⇒ z ∊ {y | ∃ o ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ h (ictk D I C o ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) ∧ q = scat h f ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))))} $ by ax
n2: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ o ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ h (ictk D I C o ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) ∧ q = scat h f ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))))} ⇒ z ∊ {x7 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (ictk D I C x1 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 x1 W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) ∧ x6 ∊ ihv D x1 (imrel D M) x3 x4 (cdm x2) ∧ q = scat x6 x2 ∧ x7 ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C x3 W) (cres x5 (inidx D I))))} $ by iminv_elim [n1, m4]
n3: $ G ⇒ {y | ∃ o ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ h (ictk D I C o ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) ∧ q = scat h f ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))))} ⊆ {x7 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (ictk D I C x1 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 x1 W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) ∧ x6 ∊ ihv D x1 (imrel D M) x3 x4 (cdm x2) ∧ q = scat x6 x2 ∧ x7 ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C x3 W) (cres x5 (inidx D I))))} $ by subset_intro [n2]

lemma d3_imin_sub (G: hyps) (E E2 D I C W S M: class) (u: set):
  $ G ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ > $ G ⇒ imin u E D I C W S M ⊆ imin u E2 D I C W S M $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ iminq u E D I C W S M ⊆ iminq u E2 D I C W S M $ by d3_iminq_sub [#1, #2]
l2: $ G ⇒ eagr E2 E D $ by eagr_sym [#2]
l3: $ G ⇒ iminq u E2 D I C W S M ⊆ iminq u E D I C W S M $ by d3_iminq_sub [#1, l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ iminq u E D I C W S M = iminq u E2 D I C W S M $ by subset_antisym [l1, l3]
l5a: $ G , q ∊ iminq u E D I C W S M ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
l5b: $ G , q ∊ iminq u E D I C W S M ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ by weaken [#2]
l5: $ G , q ∊ iminq u E D I C W S M ⇒ {y | ∃ o ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ h (ictk D I C o ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) ∧ q = scat h f ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))))} ⊆ {x7 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (ictk D I C x1 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 x1 W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) ∧ x6 ∊ ihv D x1 (imrel D M) x3 x4 (cdm x2) ∧ q = scat x6 x2 ∧ x7 ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C x3 W) (cres x5 (inidx D I))))} $ by d3_iminv_sub [l5a, l5b]
l6: $ G ⇒ q ∊ iminq u E D I C W S M → {y | ∃ o ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ h (ictk D I C o ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) ∧ q = scat h f ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))))} ⊆ {x7 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (ictk D I C x1 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 x1 W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) ∧ x6 ∊ ihv D x1 (imrel D M) x3 x4 (cdm x2) ∧ q = scat x6 x2 ∧ x7 ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C x3 W) (cres x5 (inidx D I))))} $ by imp_intro [l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ ∀ q (q ∊ iminq u E D I C W S M → {y | ∃ o ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ h (ictk D I C o ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) ∧ q = scat h f ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))))} ⊆ {x7 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (ictk D I C x1 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 x1 W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) ∧ x6 ∊ ihv D x1 (imrel D M) x3 x4 (cdm x2) ∧ q = scat x6 x2 ∧ x7 ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C x3 W) (cres x5 (inidx D I))))}) $ by all_intro [l6]
l8: $ G ⇒ fpi q (iminq u E D I C W S M) {y | ∃ o ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a ∃ h (ictk D I C o ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) ∧ h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) ∧ q = scat h f ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C g W) (cres a (inidx D I))))} ⊆ fpi q (iminq u E2 D I C W S M) {x7 | ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (ictk D I C x1 ∧ ⟨ x2 , ⟨ x3 , ⟨ x4 , x5 ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E2 x1 W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E2 D W))) ∧ x6 ∊ ihv D x1 (imrel D M) x3 x4 (cdm x2) ∧ q = scat x6 x2 ∧ x7 ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) I) (scons (itup D I C x3 W) (cres x5 (inidx D I))))} $ by fpi_sub [l4, l7]

lemma d3_imins_sub (G: hyps) (E E2 D W S M: class) (u: set):
  $ G ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ > $ G ⇒ imins u E D W S M ⊆ imins u E2 D W S M $
----
a0: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} ⇒ z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} $ by ax
a1: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} ⇒ ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D i c W S M) $ by cab_elim [a0]
c1: $ ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D i c W S M) ⟺ ∃ a ∃ c (iminx D a c k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a c W S M) $ by ex_alpha
c2: $ ∃ c (iminx D a c k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a c W S M) ⟺ ∃ b (iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M) $ by ex_alpha
c3: $ ∃ a ∃ c (iminx D a c k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a c W S M) ⟺ ∃ a ∃ b (iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M) $ by ex_congr [c2]
c4: $ ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D i c W S M) ⟺ ∃ a ∃ b (iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M) $ by iff_trans [c1, c3]
c5: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} ⇒ ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D i c W S M) ↔ ∃ a ∃ b (iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M) $ by weaken [c4]
a2: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} ⇒ ∃ a ∃ b (iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M) $ by bi_elim_l [c5, a1]
b1: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} , iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M ⇒ iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M $ by ax
b2: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} , iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M ⇒ iminx D a b k $ by and_elim_l [b1]
b3: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} , iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M ⇒ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M $ by and_elim_r [b1]
b4: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} , iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M ⇒ D ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
b5: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} , iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M ⇒ eagr E E2 D $ by weaken [#2]
b6: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} , iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M ⇒ imin u E D a b W S M ⊆ imin u E2 D a b W S M $ by d3_imin_sub [b4, b5]
b7: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} , iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M ⇒ z ∊ imin u E2 D a b W S M $ by subset_elim [b6, b3]
b8: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ i ∃ c (iminx D i c k ∧ y ∊ imin u E D i c W S M)} , iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E D a b W S M ⇒ iminx D a b k ∧ z ∊ imin u E2 D a b W S M $ by and_intro [b2, b7]
