lemma i0_imrel_sub (G: hyps) (D D2 M M2: class): $ G ⇒ D = D2 $ > $ G ⇒ M = M2 $ > $ G ⇒ imrel D M ⊆ imrel D2 M2 $
----
m0: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j))) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j))) $ by ax
ml0: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j))) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [m0]
mr0: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j))) ⇒ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j))) $ by and_elim_r [m0]
n1: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j))) ⇒ D = D2 $ by weaken [#1]
