ea3: $ G , ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) ⇒ ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) $ by ax
eb3: $ G , ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) ⇒ z ∊ imrel D2 M2 $ by ex_elim [ea3, y2]
ea2: $ G , ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) $ by ax
eb2: $ G , ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) ⇒ z ∊ imrel D2 M2 $ by ex_elim [ea2, eb3]
ea1: $ G , ∃ a ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) ⇒ ∃ a ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) $ by ax
eb1: $ G , ∃ a ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) ⇒ z ∊ imrel D2 M2 $ by ex_elim [ea1, eb2]
ea0: $ G , ∃ j ∃ a ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) ⇒ ∃ j ∃ a ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) $ by ax
eb0: $ G , ∃ j ∃ a ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) ⇒ z ∊ imrel D2 M2 $ by ex_elim [ea0, eb1]
f1: $ G , z ∊ imrel D M ⇒ z ∊ {z | ∃ j ∃ a ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j))))} $ by ax
f2: $ G , z ∊ imrel D M ⇒ ∃ j ∃ a ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , x ⟩ ⟩ , y ⟩ ∧ y ∊ apn (vat M (intys D) j) (scons x (cres a (inidx D j)))) $ by cab_elim [f1]
f3: $ G , z ∊ imrel D M ⇒ z ∊ imrel D2 M2 $ by cut [f2, eb0]
f4: $ G ⇒ imrel D M ⊆ imrel D2 M2 $ by subset_intro [f3]

imrel_eq
--------
q1: $ G ⇒ imrel D M ⊆ imrel D2 M2 $ by i0_imrel_sub [#1, #2]
qs0: $ G ⇒ D2 = D $ by eq_sym [#1]
qs1: $ G ⇒ M2 = M $ by eq_sym [#2]
q2: $ G ⇒ imrel D2 M2 ⊆ imrel D M $ by i0_imrel_sub [qs0, qs1]
q3: $ G ⇒ imrel D M = imrel D2 M2 $ by subset_antisym [q1, q2]

lemma i0_imq_sub (G: hyps) (E D D2 J J2 W W2 S S2: class) (u: set): $ G ⇒ D = D2 $ > $ G ⇒ J = J2 $ > $ G ⇒ W = W2 $ > $ G ⇒ S = S2 $ > $ G ⇒ imq u E D J W S ⊆ imq u E D2 J2 W2 S2 $
----
k1: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ ityf D J o $ by ax
k2: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S $ by ax
k3: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) $ by ax
k4: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ z = scons x f $ by ax
w1: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ D = D2 $ by weaken [#1]
w2: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ J = J2 $ by weaken [#2]
w3: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ W = W2 $ by weaken [#3]
w4: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ S = S2 $ by weaken [#4]
ro: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ o = o $ by eq_refl
rf: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ f = f $ by eq_refl
m1: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ ityf D2 J2 o $ by ityf_eq [w1, w2, ro, k1]
m2a: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ etel u E o W S = etel u E o W2 S2 $ by etel_eq [ro, w3, w4]
m2: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W2 S2 $ by wcel_eq_r [m2a, k2]
m3a: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ ity u E D J W = ity u E D2 J2 W2 $ by ity_eq [w1, w2, w3]
rs: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ scat f S = scat f S2 $ by scat_eq [rf, w4]
m3b: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) = apn (ity u E D2 J2 W2) (scat f S2) $ by apn_eq [m3a, rs]
m3: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ x ∊ apn (ity u E D2 J2 W2) (scat f S2) $ by welc_eq [m3b, k3]
m4: $ G , ityf D J o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W S , x ∊ apn (ity u E D J W) (scat f S) , z = scons x f ⇒ z ∊ imq u E D2 J2 W2 S2 $ by imq_intro [m1, m2, m3, k4]
n1: $ G , z ∊ imq u E D J W S ⇒ z ∊ imq u E D J W S $ by ax
n2: $ G , z ∊ imq u E D J W S ⇒ z ∊ imq u E D2 J2 W2 S2 $ by imq_elim [n1, m4]
n3: $ G ⇒ imq u E D J W S ⊆ imq u E D2 J2 W2 S2 $ by subset_intro [n2]

imq_eq
------
q1: $ G ⇒ imq u E D J W S ⊆ imq u E D2 J2 W2 S2 $ by i0_imq_sub [#1, #2, #3, #4]
qs0: $ G ⇒ D2 = D $ by eq_sym [#1]
qs1: $ G ⇒ J2 = J $ by eq_sym [#2]
qs2: $ G ⇒ W2 = W $ by eq_sym [#3]
qs3: $ G ⇒ S2 = S $ by eq_sym [#4]
q2: $ G ⇒ imq u E D2 J2 W2 S2 ⊆ imq u E D J W S $ by i0_imq_sub [qs0, qs1, qs2, qs3]
q3: $ G ⇒ imq u E D J W S = imq u E D2 J2 W2 S2 $ by subset_antisym [q1, q2]

lemma i0_imot_sub (G: hyps) (E D D2 J J2 W W2 S S2 V V2: class) (u: set): $ G ⇒ D = D2 $ > $ G ⇒ J = J2 $ > $ G ⇒ W = W2 $ > $ G ⇒ S = S2 $ > $ G ⇒ V = V2 $ > $ G ⇒ imot u E D J W S V ⊆ imot u E D2 J2 W2 S2 V2 $
----
l4: $ G ⇒ imq u E D J W S = imq u E D2 J2 W2 S2 $ by imq_eq [#1, #2, #3, #4]
l5a: $ G , q ∊ imq u E D J W S ⇒ V = V2 $ by weaken [#5]
l5b: $ G , q ∊ imq u E D J W S ⇒ uni = uni $ by eq_refl
l5c: $ G , q ∊ imq u E D J W S ⇒ fv uni V = fv uni V2 $ by fv_eq [l5b, l5a]
l5: $ G , q ∊ imq u E D J W S ⇒ fv uni V ⊆ fv uni V2 $ by eq_subset [l5c]
l6: $ G ⇒ q ∊ imq u E D J W S → fv uni V ⊆ fv uni V2 $ by imp_intro [l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ ∀ q (q ∊ imq u E D J W S → fv uni V ⊆ fv uni V2) $ by all_intro [l6]
l8: $ G ⇒ fpi q (imq u E D J W S) (fv uni V) ⊆ fpi q (imq u E D2 J2 W2 S2) (fv uni V2) $ by fpi_sub [l4, l7]

