k1: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ ictk D I C o $ by ax
k2: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) $ by ax
k3: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) $ by ax
k4: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ z = scat h f $ by ax
w1: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ D = D2 $ by weaken [#1]
w2: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ I = I2 $ by weaken [#2]
w3: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ C = C2 $ by weaken [#3]
w4: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ W = W2 $ by weaken [#4]
w5: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ S = S2 $ by weaken [#5]
w6: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ M = M2 $ by weaken [#6]
ro: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ o = o $ by eq_refl
rg: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ g = g $ by eq_refl
rt: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ t = t $ by eq_refl
rcf: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ cdm f = cdm f $ by eq_refl
m1: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ ictk D2 I2 C2 o $ by ictk_eq [w1, w2, w3, ro, k1]
m2a: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ ifam u E D W = ifam u E D2 W2 $ by ifam_eq [w1, w4]
m2b: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ ixs D W (ifam u E D W) = ixs D2 W2 (ifam u E D2 W2) $ by ixs_eq [w1, w4, m2a]
m2c: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W)) = scat S2 (ixs D2 W2 (ifam u E D2 W2)) $ by scat_eq [w5, m2b]
m2r: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ o = o $ by eq_refl
m2d: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) = etel u E o W2 (scat S2 (ixs D2 W2 (ifam u E D2 W2))) $ by etel_eq [m2r, w4, m2c]
m2: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W2 (scat S2 (ixs D2 W2 (ifam u E D2 W2))) $ by wcel_eq_r [m2d, k2]
m3a: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ imrel D M = imrel D2 M2 $ by imrel_eq [w1, w6]
m3b: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) = ihv D2 o (imrel D2 M2) g t (cdm f) $ by ihv_eq [w1, ro, m3a, rg, rt, rcf]
m3: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ h ∊ ihv D2 o (imrel D2 M2) g t (cdm f) $ by welc_eq [m3b, k3]
m4: $ G , ictk D I C o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , h ∊ ihv D o (imrel D M) g t (cdm f) , z = scat h f ⇒ z ∊ iminq u E D2 I2 C2 W2 S2 M2 $ by iminq_intro [m1, m2, m3, k4]
n1: $ G , z ∊ iminq u E D I C W S M ⇒ z ∊ iminq u E D I C W S M $ by ax
n2: $ G , z ∊ iminq u E D I C W S M ⇒ z ∊ iminq u E D2 I2 C2 W2 S2 M2 $ by iminq_elim [n1, m4]
