iminq_eq
--------
q1: $ G ⇒ iminq u E D I C W S M ⊆ iminq u E D2 I2 C2 W2 S2 M2 $ by i0_iminq_sub [#1, #2, #3, #4, #5, #6]
qs0: $ G ⇒ D2 = D $ by eq_sym [#1]
qs1: $ G ⇒ I2 = I $ by eq_sym [#2]
qs2: $ G ⇒ C2 = C $ by eq_sym [#3]
qs3: $ G ⇒ W2 = W $ by eq_sym [#4]
