m7d: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D2 j c g W2 ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M2 (inmin D2) k) (scat h f) ⟩ $ by opair_eq [m7c, m6c]
m7: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D2 j c g W2 ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M2 (inmin D2) k) (scat h f) ⟩ $ by eq_trans [k7, m7d]
m8: $ G , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W (scat S (ixs D W (ifam u E D W))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D W , h ∊ ihv D o R g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g W ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat M (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E D2 W2 S2 M2 R2 $ by ifold0_intro [m1, m2, m3, m4, m5, m6, m7]
n1: $ G , z ∊ ifold0 u E D W S M R ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E D W S M R $ by ax
n2: $ G , z ∊ ifold0 u E D W S M R ⇒ z ∊ ifold0 u E D2 W2 S2 M2 R2 $ by ifold0_elim [n1, m8]
