ifold0_eq
---------
q1: $ G ⇒ ifold0 u E D W S M R ⊆ ifold0 u E D2 W2 S2 M2 R2 $ by i0_ifold0_sub [#1, #2, #3, #4, #5]
qs0: $ G ⇒ D2 = D $ by eq_sym [#1]
qs1: $ G ⇒ W2 = W $ by eq_sym [#2]
qs2: $ G ⇒ S2 = S $ by eq_sym [#3]
qs3: $ G ⇒ M2 = M $ by eq_sym [#4]
qs4: $ G ⇒ R2 = R $ by eq_sym [#5]
