k2: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ p ∊ esat u E q W $ by ax
