m2a: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ esat u E q W = esat u E q W2 $ by ap_eq [rf1, w4]
m2: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ p ∊ esat u E q W2 $ by welc_eq [m2a, k2]
m3a: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ imots u E D W p V ⊆ imots u E D2 W2 p V2 $ by i0_imots_sub [w1, w4, rp, w3]
m3: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ m ∊ imots u E D2 W2 p V2 $ by subset_elim [m3a, k3]
m4a: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ imins u E D W p m ⊆ imins u E D2 W2 p m $ by i0_imins_sub [w1, w4, rp, rm]
m4: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ n ∊ imins u E D2 W2 p m $ by subset_elim [m4a, k4]
m5: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ ityf D2 I2 o $ by ityf_eq [w1, w2, ro, k5]
m6a: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ etel u E o W p = etel u E o W2 p $ by etel_eq [ro, w4, rp]
m6: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W2 p $ by wcel_eq_r [m6a, k6]
m7a: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ ity u E D I W = ity u E D2 I2 W2 $ by ity_eq [w1, w2, w4]
m7b: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) = apn (ity u E D2 I2 W2) (scat f p) $ by apn_eq [m7a, rsf]
m7: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ x ∊ apn (ity u E D2 I2 W2) (scat f p) $ by welc_eq [m7b, k7]
m8a: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ ifold u E D W p n = ifold u E D2 W2 p n $ by ifold_eq [w1, w4, rp, rn]
m8b: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ I2 , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [w2, rkx]
m8c: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ = fv (ifold u E D2 W2 p n) ⟨ I2 , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ $ by fv_eq [m8a, m8b]
m8: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ y ∊ fv (ifold u E D2 W2 p n) ⟨ I2 , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ $ by welc_eq [m8c, k8]
m9: $ G , iprt D q e , p ∊ esat u E q W , m ∊ imots u E D W p V , n ∊ imins u E D W p m , ityf D I o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o W p , x ∊ apn (ity u E D I W) (scat f p) , y ∊ fv (ifold u E D W p n) ⟨ I , ⟨ scat f p , x ⟩ ⟩ , z = nest (scat (scons x f) (scat n (scat m p))) y ⇒ z ∊ irc u E D2 I2 V2 W2 $ by irc_intro [m1, m2, m3, m4, m5, m6, m7, m8, k9]
n1: $ G , z ∊ irc u E D I V W ⇒ z ∊ irc u E D I V W $ by ax
n2: $ G , z ∊ irc u E D I V W ⇒ z ∊ irc u E D2 I2 V2 W2 $ by irc_elim [n1, m9]
n3: $ G ⇒ irc u E D I V W ⊆ irc u E D2 I2 V2 W2 $ by subset_intro [n2]

irc_eq
------
q1: $ G ⇒ irc u E D I V W ⊆ irc u E D2 I2 V2 W2 $ by i0_irc_sub [#1, #2, #3, #4]
qs0: $ G ⇒ D2 = D $ by eq_sym [#1]
qs1: $ G ⇒ I2 = I $ by eq_sym [#2]
qs2: $ G ⇒ V2 = V $ by eq_sym [#3]
qs3: $ G ⇒ W2 = W $ by eq_sym [#4]
q2: $ G ⇒ irc u E D2 I2 V2 W2 ⊆ irc u E D I V W $ by i0_irc_sub [qs0, qs1, qs2, qs3]
q3: $ G ⇒ irc u E D I V W = irc u E D2 I2 V2 W2 $ by subset_antisym [q1, q2]

--| The points of `hrec`.
lemma d3_hrec_cases {u d j v e w: set} (G H: hyps w) (a b: set) (q: fml):
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∈ hrec $ > $ H , ⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩ ⇒ q $ > $ G , H ⇒ q $
----
m1: $ H ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩ → q $ by imp_intro [#2]
m2: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩ ⇒ x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ $ by ax
m3: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩ ⇒ x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩ $ by ax
m4: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = x0 $ by eq_sym [m2]
m5: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩ $ by eq_trans [m4, m3]
m6: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩ → q $ by weaken [m1]
m7: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩ ⇒ q $ by imp_elim [m6, m5]
x4: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) ⇒ ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) $ by ax
e4: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) ⇒ q $ by ex_elim [x4, m7]
x3: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , ∃ v ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) ⇒ ∃ v ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) $ by ax
e3: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , ∃ v ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) ⇒ q $ by ex_elim [x3, e4]
x2: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , ∃ j ∃ v ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) ⇒ ∃ j ∃ v ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) $ by ax
e2: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , ∃ j ∃ v ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) ⇒ q $ by ex_elim [x2, e3]
x1: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , ∃ d ∃ j ∃ v ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) ⇒ ∃ d ∃ j ∃ v ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) $ by ax
e1: $ H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , ∃ d ∃ j ∃ v ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) ⇒ q $ by ex_elim [x1, e2]
l1: $ G , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x0 ∊ hrec ⇒ x0 ∊ hrec $ by ax
l2: $ G , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x0 ∊ hrec ⇒ ∃ u ∃ d ∃ j ∃ v ∃ e (x0 = ⟨ ⟨ u , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons d (scons j (scons v ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc u e d (fv nvf j) (lv v w) w) ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , H , x0 = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , x0 ∊ hrec ⇒ q $ by ex_elim [l2, e1]
l4: $ G , H ⇒ q $ by wcel_elim [#1, l3]

hrec_functional
---------------
d1: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ hrec ∧ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ hrec , ⟨ x , y ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ a , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons b (scons c (scons d ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc a e b (fv nvf c) (lv d w) w) ⟩ , ⟨ x , z ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ f , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons g (scons h (scons k ∅)) , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc f l g (fv nvf h) (lv k w) w) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ a , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons b (scons c (scons d ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc a e b (fv nvf c) (lv d w) w) ⟩ $ by ax
d2: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ hrec ∧ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ hrec , ⟨ x , y ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ a , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons b (scons c (scons d ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc a e b (fv nvf c) (lv d w) w) ⟩ , ⟨ x , z ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ f , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons g (scons h (scons k ∅)) , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc f l g (fv nvf h) (lv k w) w) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ f , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons g (scons h (scons k ∅)) , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc f l g (fv nvf h) (lv k w) w) ⟩ $ by ax
d3: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ hrec ∧ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ hrec , ⟨ x , y ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ a , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons b (scons c (scons d ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc a e b (fv nvf c) (lv d w) w) ⟩ , ⟨ x , z ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ f , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons g (scons h (scons k ∅)) , l ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc f l g (fv nvf h) (lv k w) w) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ a , ⟨ kc_ind_rec , ⟨ scons b (scons c (scons d ∅)) , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ , clam w lvals (irc a e b (fv nvf c) (lv d w) w) ⟩ = ⟨ x , y ⟩ $ by eq_sym [d1]
